{"seq":2,"slug":"ocr-document","title":"OCR 与文档处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/cv-applications/ocr-document","wordCount":1734,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"ocr-与文档处理\">OCR 与文档处理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>OCR（Optical Character Recognition，光学字符识别）将图像中的文字内容转换为可编辑的电子文本。现代 OCR 系统已经从单纯的字符识别发展为完整的文档理解系统，涵盖文字检测、文字识别、版面分析和结构化信息提取四大能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[文档图像] --&gt; B[文字检测]&#10;    B --&gt; C[文字行裁剪]&#10;    C --&gt; D[文字识别]&#10;    D --&gt; E[结构化输出]&#10;    A --&gt; F[版面分析]&#10;    F --&gt; G[区域分类]&#10;    G --&gt; E\">graph LR\n    A[文档图像] --&gt; B[文字检测]\n    B --&gt; C[文字行裁剪]\n    C --&gt; D[文字识别]\n    D --&gt; E[结构化输出]\n    A --&gt; F[版面分析]\n    F --&gt; G[区域分类]\n    G --&gt; E</pre><p>OCR 面临的核心挑战包括：自然场景中的复杂背景、不规则排列的文字（弯曲、旋转、透视变形）、多语言混排、手写体识别以及低质量图像（模糊、低分辨率、光照不均）。文档级理解还需要处理表格、公式和图表等复杂版面结构。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>OCR 任务</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>核心挑战</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文字检测</td>\n<td>图像</td>\n<td>文字区域坐标</td>\n<td>不规则形状</td>\n<td>DBNet, EAST</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文字识别</td>\n<td>文字行图像</td>\n<td>字符序列</td>\n<td>字体多样性</td>\n<td>CRNN, ABINet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版面分析</td>\n<td>文档图像</td>\n<td>区域类型+坐标</td>\n<td>复杂版面</td>\n<td>LayoutLMv3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端</td>\n<td>图像</td>\n<td>文字+位置</td>\n<td>联合优化</td>\n<td>PaddleOCR, TrOCR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表格识别</td>\n<td>表格图像</td>\n<td>结构化表格</td>\n<td>合并单元格</td>\n<td>TableFormer</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"文字检测方法\">文字检测方法</h2><p>文字检测负责定位图像中所有文字区域的精确位置。不同于通用目标检测，文字具有极端的宽高比（细长文字行）和不规则形状（弯曲文字），需要专门设计的检测方法。</p>\n<p>DBNet（Differentiable Binarization Network）是当前最流行的文字检测方法之一。它通过可微分的二值化操作替代了传统的后处理阈值化步骤，使得整个检测流水线可以端到端训练。DBNet 预测三个图：概率图（文字区域概率）、阈值图（自适应阈值）和二值图（最终检测结果），其中阈值图使得模型能够为不同区域学习不同的阈值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class DBHead(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, in_channels):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.probability = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(in_channels, in_channels // 4, 3, padding=1),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm2d(in_channels // 4),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.ConvTranspose2d(in_channels // 4, in_channels // 4, 2, 2),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(in_channels // 4, 1, 1),&#10;            nn.Sigmoid(),&#10;        )&#10;        self.threshold = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(in_channels, in_channels // 4, 3, padding=1),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm2d(in_channels // 4),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.ConvTranspose2d(in_channels // 4, in_channels // 4, 2, 2),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(in_channels // 4, 1, 1),&#10;            nn.Sigmoid(),&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        prob = self.probability(x)&#10;        thresh = self.threshold(x)&#10;        binary = self.step_function(prob, thresh)&#10;        return prob, thresh, binary&#10;&#10;    def step_function(self, prob, thresh, k=50):&#10;        return torch.reciprocal(1.0 + torch.exp(-k * (prob - thresh)))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DBHead</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, in_channels):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.probability </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(in_channels, in_channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.BatchNorm2d(in_channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ConvTranspose2d(in_channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, in_channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(in_channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Sigmoid(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.threshold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(in_channels, in_channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.BatchNorm2d(in_channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ConvTranspose2d(in_channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, in_channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(in_channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Sigmoid(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        prob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.probability(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        thresh </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.threshold(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        binary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.step_function(prob, thresh)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prob, thresh, binary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> step_function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, prob, thresh, k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.reciprocal(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.exp(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (prob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> thresh)))</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph DBNet 检测流程&#10;        A[输入图像] --&gt; B[FPN 特征]&#10;        B --&gt; C[概率图 P]&#10;        B --&gt; D[阈值图 T]&#10;        C --&gt; E[可微二值化]&#10;        D --&gt; E&#10;        E --&gt; F[二值图 B]&#10;        F --&gt; G[轮廓提取]&#10;        G --&gt; H[文字多边形]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph DBNet 检测流程\n        A[输入图像] --&gt; B[FPN 特征]\n        B --&gt; C[概率图 P]\n        B --&gt; D[阈值图 T]\n        C --&gt; E[可微二值化]\n        D --&gt; E\n        E --&gt; F[二值图 B]\n        F --&gt; G[轮廓提取]\n        G --&gt; H[文字多边形]\n    end</pre><p>EAST（Efficient and Accurate Scene Text Detector）直接在每个像素位置回归到文字框四条边的距离和旋转角度，无需锚框设计。对于弯曲文字，FCENet 使用傅里叶轮廓编码来表示任意形状的文字区域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"文字识别与序列解码\">文字识别与序列解码</h2><p>文字识别将检测到的文字行图像转换为字符序列。这是一个图像到序列（Image-to-Sequence）的问题，核心挑战在于字符数量不固定、字符间距不均匀以及字体样式多变。</p>\n<p>CRNN（Convolutional Recurrent Neural Network）是经典的文字识别架构。它由 CNN 特征提取器、BiLSTM 序列建模器和 CTC（Connectionist Temporal Classification）解码器三部分组成。CNN 将图像编码为特征序列，BiLSTM 建模字符间的上下文关系，CTC 解码处理输入-输出长度不对齐的问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class CRNNRecognizer(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, num_chars, hidden_size=256):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.cnn = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(1, 64, 3, 1, 1), nn.ReLU(), nn.MaxPool2d(2, 2),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(64, 128, 3, 1, 1), nn.ReLU(), nn.MaxPool2d(2, 2),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(128, 256, 3, 1, 1), nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(256, 256, 3, 1, 1), nn.ReLU(), nn.MaxPool2d((2, 1)),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(256, 512, 3, 1, 1), nn.BatchNorm2d(512), nn.ReLU(),&#10;        )&#10;        self.rnn = nn.LSTM(512, hidden_size, num_layers=2, bidirectional=True, batch_first=True)&#10;        self.fc = nn.Linear(hidden_size * 2, num_chars)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        features = self.cnn(x)&#10;        b, c, h, w = features.shape&#10;        features = features.squeeze(2).permute(0, 2, 1)&#10;        rnn_out, _ = self.rnn(features)&#10;        output = self.fc(rnn_out)&#10;        return output\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CRNNRecognizer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, num_chars, hidden_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.cnn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), nn.ReLU(), nn.MaxPool2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), nn.ReLU(), nn.MaxPool2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), nn.ReLU(), nn.MaxPool2d((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), nn.BatchNorm2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.rnn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.LSTM(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, hidden_size, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">num_layers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bidirectional</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">batch_first</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(hidden_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, num_chars)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.cnn(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        b, c, h, w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> features.shape</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> features.squeeze(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).permute(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        rnn_out, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.rnn(features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        output </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fc(rnn_out)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> output</span></span></code></pre></div><p>基于注意力的方法（如 ABINet、PARSeq）使用 Transformer 解码器替代 CTC，通过注意力机制隐式对齐图像特征和字符序列。TrOCR 直接将预训练的视觉 Transformer 和语言模型组合，在打印体和手写体识别上都取得了最佳效果。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>解码方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CRNN + CTC</td>\n<td>CTC 对齐</td>\n<td>规则文字</td>\n<td>简单高效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ASTER</td>\n<td>注意力 + STN</td>\n<td>不规则文字</td>\n<td>空间校正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ABINet</td>\n<td>迭代注意力</td>\n<td>复杂场景</td>\n<td>语言模型辅助</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TrOCR</td>\n<td>Transformer</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n<td>预训练优势</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"版面分析与文档理解\">版面分析与文档理解</h2><p>版面分析将文档图像划分为不同的语义区域（标题、段落、表格、图片等），是文档结构化理解的基础。传统方法使用规则匹配和连通域分析，现代方法则使用深度学习进行区域检测和分类。</p>\n<p>LayoutLM 系列将文档的文本内容、视觉特征和空间位置信息融合进行多模态预训练，实现了文档理解的多种下游任务。LayoutLMv3 使用统一的 Transformer 架构同时处理文本和图像 patch，在文档分类、信息提取和表格理解等任务上都取得了出色效果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from paddleocr import PaddleOCR&#10;&#10;ocr = PaddleOCR(use_angle_cls=True, lang=&#39;ch&#39;)&#10;&#10;result = ocr.ocr(&#39;document.jpg&#39;, cls=True)&#10;for line in result[0]:&#10;    bbox = line[0]&#10;    text = line[1][0]&#10;    confidence = line[1][1]&#10;    print(f&quot;文字: {text}, 置信度: {confidence:.3f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> paddleocr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PaddleOCR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ocr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PaddleOCR(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">use_angle_cls</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lang</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ocr.ocr(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'document.jpg'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cls</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> line </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bbox </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> line[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    text </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> line[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    confidence </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> line[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"文字: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">text</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, 置信度: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">confidence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.3f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>PaddleOCR 是百度开源的工业级 OCR 解决方案，提供了完整的文字检测（DB/EAST）、方向分类和文字识别（CRNN/SVTR）流水线，支持 80+ 语言，在中文场景下效果尤其出色。PP-OCRv4 通过知识蒸馏和模型压缩实现了移动端实时部署；2025 年随 PaddleOCR 3.x 发布的 PP-OCRv5 进一步统一了简体中文、繁体中文、拼音、英文、日文等多文种、多场景的识别能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"vlm-端到端-ocr-ocr-2-0-范式\">VLM 端到端 OCR：OCR-2.0 范式</h2><p>传统 OCR 将检测、识别、版面分析拆分为流水线，而视觉语言模型（VLM）把整页图像直接映射为结构化文本，一条前向即可输出带版面的 Markdown/JSON。GOT-OCR2.0（2024，arXiv:2409.01704）提出「通用 OCR 理论」，把普通文本、数学公式、表格、图表乃至乐谱都视为广义「字符」，用一个约 580M 参数的统一端到端模型覆盖全部光学符号，宣告了从 OCR-1.0 到 OCR-2.0 的范式转变。Qwen2-VL（arXiv:2409.12191）凭借原生动态分辨率设计，在场景文字与文档解析基准上达到当时最强水平，使「对话即 OCR」成为现实。DeepSeek-OCR（2025 年 10 月，arXiv:2510.18234）则进一步探索「上下文光学压缩」——用极少量视觉 token 表示大量文本 token（DeepEncoder + MoE 解码器），在高压缩比下仍保持高保真解码，提示了光学二维映射作为长上下文压缩手段的可能性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路线</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>流水线 OCR</td>\n<td>PaddleOCR / PP-OCRv5</td>\n<td>图像</td>\n<td>文本+框</td>\n<td>高吞吐、可解释生产链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档理解预训练</td>\n<td>LayoutLMv3</td>\n<td>图文对</td>\n<td>区域分类/信息抽取</td>\n<td>表单、票据结构化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VLM 端到端</td>\n<td>GOT-OCR2.0 / Qwen2-VL / DeepSeek-OCR</td>\n<td>整页图像</td>\n<td>Markdown/JSON</td>\n<td>公式表格图表混排文档</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工程选型上，大规模、低延迟的文字提取仍适合流水线方案（PP-OCRv5）；公式、表格、图表混排的复杂文档，或需要直接输出结构化 Markdown 的场景，VLM 端到端模型已是更优甚至默认的选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((OCR 与文档处理))&#10;    文字检测&#10;      DBNet&#10;      EAST&#10;      FCENet&#10;    文字识别&#10;      CRNN + CTC&#10;      Transformer&#10;      TrOCR&#10;    文档理解&#10;      LayoutLMv3&#10;      PaddleOCR&#10;      表格识别&#10;    VLM 端到端&#10;      GOT-OCR2.0&#10;      Qwen2-VL&#10;      DeepSeek-OCR\">mindmap\n  root((OCR 与文档处理))\n    文字检测\n      DBNet\n      EAST\n      FCENet\n    文字识别\n      CRNN + CTC\n      Transformer\n      TrOCR\n    文档理解\n      LayoutLMv3\n      PaddleOCR\n      表格识别\n    VLM 端到端\n      GOT-OCR2.0\n      Qwen2-VL\n      DeepSeek-OCR</pre><ul>\n<li>OCR 系统由文字检测、识别和版面分析三大模块组成</li>\n<li>DBNet 通过可微二值化实现了高效精确的文字检测</li>\n<li>CRNN + CTC 是文字识别的经典架构，Transformer 方法正逐步取代</li>\n<li>PaddleOCR 是最完善的开源 OCR 工具链，中文效果优异，PP-OCRv5 已统一多文种识别</li>\n<li>版面分析和文档理解需要多模态融合，LayoutLMv3 是流水线方案的主流选择</li>\n<li>VLM 端到端模型（GOT-OCR2.0/Qwen2-VL/DeepSeek-OCR）正以「图像进、结构化文本出」替代传统多级流水线</li>\n<li>实际项目中推荐使用 PaddleOCR 或 EasyOCR 作为起点快速构建原型；复杂版面文档优先试用 VLM 端到端方案</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"OCR 与文档处理","id":"ocr-与文档处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"文字检测方法","id":"文字检测方法"},{"level":2,"text":"文字识别与序列解码","id":"文字识别与序列解码"},{"level":2,"text":"版面分析与文档理解","id":"版面分析与文档理解"},{"level":2,"text":"VLM 端到端 OCR：OCR-2.0 范式","id":"vlm-端到端-ocr-ocr-2-0-范式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"人脸识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/cv-applications/face-recognition"},"next":{"title":"医学影像分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/cv-applications/medical-imaging"}}